    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I pushed him off. It was the highlight of my week watching him fall.” She laughs and points to my face. “You should see ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8309
        }
      ],
      "words": 53
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I would run if I were you. I’m not here because I care about him—I care about Brawley. Seeing him miserable makes me wan",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8625
